    "detailed_description": "&quot;In the Dark&quot; is a roguelike deck-building horror card game. Collect cards, skills, items, and souls, and use them to survive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/eae4d861b51941c81b32bef8dbdd967b.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>The world was shrouded in darkness due to the impact of the meteorite, monsters have appeared, and corpses have turned into zombies. The only way to survive is to move on. Select one of three places.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/3490c483a644add6f38876d2c2a0e883.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>You can cooperate with and fight against other survivors.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/9dbd2b3cc3aeb5bd0a57020a77170ae8.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>Whenever you enter safe areas alone, ghosts will appear. In addition...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/ff13f596b342468639b25c8aad1086f8.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>A horde of zombies is a formidable foe.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/051059ffedc08738fd37f6dd540db6c4.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>Defeating a boss monster, you can choose to end the play or continue. You should consider your free time and achievements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/309d8d64e80536312177a8c88c3fbb2c.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;In the Dark&quot; is a roguelike deck-building horror card game. Collect cards, skills, items, and souls, and use them to survive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/eae4d861b51941c81b32bef8dbdd967b.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>The world was shrouded in darkness due to the impact of the meteorite, monsters have appeared, and corpses have turned into zombies. The only way to survive is to move on. Select one of three places.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/3490c483a644add6f38876d2c2a0e883.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>You can cooperate with and fight against other survivors.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/9dbd2b3cc3aeb5bd0a57020a77170ae8.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>Whenever you enter safe areas alone, ghosts will appear. In addition...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/ff13f596b342468639b25c8aad1086f8.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>A horde of zombies is a formidable foe.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/051059ffedc08738fd37f6dd540db6c4.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div><br>Defeating a boss monster, you can choose to end the play or continue. You should consider your free time and achievements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142040/extras/309d8d64e80536312177a8c88c3fbb2c.avif?t=1710113331\" /></div>",
